  "behavior": [
    "Ordinary lines use the selected face rounded ascent/descent and used leading; raw font metrics and glyph outlines remain unchanged.",
    "Mixed-size grid alignment derives the unshifted paint baseline; relative paint offsets retain their separate effect.",
    "Inline link-box placement follows the selected baseline; raw face-box height is retained.",
    "Forced breaks contribute their own and enclosing inline struts on the committed line in ordinary and float layout, including empty forced lines.",
    "Break-only inline fragments retain authored slice/clone edge lifetime and paint their first padding fragment; flow-only control markers remain excluded.",
    "HTML semantic canvas inspection and PDF logical carriers preserve their distinct layout/paint contracts; specialized short, image, script and leader routes retain their qualified policies."
  ],
